# Summary

The agreement's allocation rule for plots is: "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement." [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]

The agreement does not specify the physical size of a plot; the only statement about plots in the agreement is "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement." [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]]
